  "title": "Futu Hong Kong's June ETF Trading Users Surge 100% YoY; ETF Investment Month and \"Futu Wealth Summit 2026\" to Launch in August",
  "summary": "(Hong Kong, July 29, 2026) Futu Securities International (Hong Kong) Limited (“Futu”) announced its latest platform ETF investment data findings, indicating that ETFs are quickly emerging as a key gateway for Hong Kong investors to enter the market. ETFs have risen to become the second-largest investment category for users’ first trades, after individual stocks, reflecting a gradual shift among investors towards an asset allocation-driven investment approach.",
